# Uploaded design files live here, and nothing in here is ever a URL.
#
# backend/.htaccess already refuses the whole folder, and this file repeats
# that refusal so the storage directory stays shut even if the parent rules
# are edited, replaced or simply not read by a different web server.
#
# The only way an attachment should ever reach a browser is through
# admin/attachment.php, which checks the signed-in session first and then
# sends the file as a download.

Require all denied

Options -Indexes
